    [Doc][Misc] Deprecate discontinued models and update support matrix (#19818)
    
    ### What this PR does / why we need it?
    
    This pull request deprecates several discontinued models (including
    DeepSeek-OCR-2, Hunyuan-A13B-Instruct, InternVL3.5,
    LLaVA-OneVision-Qwen2-0.5B-OV, Minitron-8B-Base,
    Mixtral-8x7B-Instruct-v0.1, PaddleOCR-VL, Qwen2.5-Math-RM-72B,
    Qwen3-ASR-1.7B, Qwen3-Coder-30B-A3B, Qwen3-Embedding, Qwen3-Next,
    Qwen3-Omni-30B-A3B-Thinking, Qwen3-Reranker, Qwen3-VL-Embedding,
    Qwen3-VL-Reranker, and gpt-oss-120b) since vLLM Ascend v0.30.0. Their
    detailed tutorial pages are replaced with a discontinuation notice
    pointing to the historical v0.23.0 documentation. Additionally, the
    support matrix in `supported_models.md` is updated to reflect these
    deprecations, refine the legend description, and adjust the supported
    models list.
    
    Feedback: In `Qwen3-VL-Reranker.md`, the historical documentation link
    was found to be incorrect (pointing to `Qwen3-Reranker.html` instead of
    `Qwen3-VL-Reranker.html`), which has been corrected in a review comment.
    
    ### Does this PR introduce _any_ user-facing change?
    
    Yes, documentation for discontinued models has been removed/replaced
    with discontinuation notices, and the support matrix has been updated.
    
    ### How was this patch tested?
    
    Documentation changes only. No code testing is required.
    
